# Dropping a constraint between fields widens, but the checker does not
# reason about what the prior constraint admitted, so it is Unknown.
-- old.cue --
a:  int
b?: <a
-- new.cue --
a:  int
b?: int
-- out --
unknown
b is constrained by a in the prior schema and not in the new one; the checker cannot compare constraints between fields (rule unknown-crossfield) @ new.cue:2:1
